WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:04.710
"I’ve heard enough!" shouted Toad.

2
00:00:04.711 --> 00:00:08.065
He grabbed Rat’s walking stick.

3
00:00:08.066 --> 00:00:13.445
"I’m going to Toad Hall right now!" he said.

4
00:00:13.446 --> 00:00:16.434
"It’s no good, Toad," said Rat.

5
00:00:16.435 --> 00:00:19.418
"The Wild-Wooders won’t leave!

6
00:00:19.419 --> 00:00:22.136
Come sit down."

7
00:00:22.137 --> 00:00:28.281
But Toad was already out the door.

8
00:00:28.282 --> 00:00:31.310
Toad hurried down the path.

9
00:00:31.311 --> 00:00:35.419
"I’ll get them out!" he shouted.

10
00:00:35.420 --> 00:00:37.819
"They have no right!"

11
00:00:37.820 --> 00:00:42.457
Toad stopped at the gate of Toad Hall.

12
00:00:42.458 --> 00:00:47.027
A ferret popped up from behind the gate.

13
00:00:47.028 --> 00:00:51.695
He pointed a long gun at Toad.

14
00:00:51.696 --> 00:00:58.969
"Who are you?" asked the ferret coldly.

15
00:00:58.970 --> 00:01:02.779
"Who am I?" yelled Toad.

16
00:01:02.780 --> 00:01:04.928
"I am Toad!

17
00:01:04.929 --> 00:01:08.243
Toad Hall is my house!"

18
00:01:08.244 --> 00:01:11.105
The ferret said nothing.

19
00:01:11.106 --> 00:01:14.963
He aimed his gun.

20
00:01:14.964 --> 00:01:19.078
"You can’t point that at me!" shouted Toad.

21
00:01:19.079 --> 00:01:22.679
Bang! The ferret fired.

22
00:01:22.680 --> 00:01:26.546
The bullet whizzed by Toad’s ear.

23
00:01:26.547 --> 00:01:29.042
"Hey!" cried Toad.

24
00:01:29.043 --> 00:01:32.463
"You almost hit me!"

25
00:01:32.464 --> 00:01:36.256
The ferret aimed the gun again.

26
00:01:36.257 --> 00:01:39.671
Toad threw himself on the ground.

27
00:01:39.672 --> 00:01:44.192
Bang! The bullet flew over his head.

28
00:01:44.193 --> 00:01:48.086
"I’m leaving!" yelled Toad.

29
00:01:48.087 --> 00:01:52.624
Toad stood up and ran down the road.

30
00:01:52.625 --> 00:01:58.066
"Look at the fat toad run!" shouted the ferret.

31
00:01:58.067 --> 00:02:01.392
Toad turned around.

32
00:02:01.393 --> 00:02:07.033
All the ferrets were laughing loudly.

